# Dependencies & Build Outputs
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/build/
**/.vite/
**/.vercel/
**/coverage/

# Environment & Secrets (never commit real secrets)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.production.example
**/secrets/
**/*secret*
!**/*secret*.ts
!**/*secret*.tsx
!**/*secret*.js
!**/*secret*.md

# Keys, Certificates & Credentials
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.cer
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/service-account*.json
**/credentials*.json

# Allowlist Exports, Database Dumps, Backups & Uploads
**/allowed-emails*.txt
**/*.sql.gz
**/*.dump
**/*.bak
**/backups/
**/uploads/

# Logs, Caches & OS Files
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
